# 132 exhibits, 664 MB of photographed Call Report pages -- one per bank-year,
# every value beside the line the bank filed it on. Far too large for a git
# repository, and regenerated in six minutes by
#
#     python tools/tieout/build_deep_bank_exhibits.py
#
# `manifest.csv` is the record of what exists: one row per exhibit with its
# value count, its tie count and its photograph count. One exhibit is committed
# as a specimen so a reader can see the shape without rebuilding.
*.pdf
